Checked exact preservation of density, the factors in the convolution energy, the even expansion and the distinction between instability and global periodicity. Model self-audit only; no independent human mathematical verification. Applied contribution prompt A before drafting and B afterwards. Checked exact preservation of density, the factors in the convolution energy, the even expansion and the distinction between instability and global periodicity. First remaining gap: Exclude nonperiodic infinite-volume ground states by a global comparison for the source potentials and transition threshold. The inherited source status is preserved; original-target completion remains zero.

Coordinator checked the density-wave interaction term, kinetic expansion and conditional local-instability sign. This additional check was model-assisted, not independent human verification.

